    <briefdescription>
<para>Wraps and unwraps secret keys with master keys kept in a KMS. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Mirrors Java&apos;s org.apache.iceberg.encryption.KeyManagementClient. The table master key (table property <computeroutput>encryption.key-id</computeroutput>) never leaves the KMS; it only wraps and unwraps the table&apos;s key encryption keys. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
